          "guid": "mt4g61mvaw1lpbqv",
          "message": {
            "text": "The all-page visibility isolation used for an uncorrelatable generated pseudo can make Blink blur an unrelated focused form control. Retaining the original per-frame activeElement in the private registry and restoring it before native decoration/control atlases is required to preserve source-owned :focus paint; the native-control decoration interaction matrix is the regression proof.",
            "markdown": "The all-page visibility isolation used for an uncorrelatable generated pseudo can make Blink blur an unrelated focused form control. Retaining the original per-frame activeElement in the private registry and restoring it before native decoration/control atlases is required to preserve source-owned :focus paint; the native-control decoration interaction matrix is the regression proof."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/pseudo-fragment-cdp.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 593,
                  "endLine": 602,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      // A terminal pseudo isolation temporarily hides the rest of the page.\n      // Blink blurs a focused control when that stylesheet makes it hidden;\n      // restore the source-owned interaction state before downstream native\n      // decoration/control atlases snapshot :focus paint.\n      const activeElement = registry.activeElement;\n      if (activeElement instanceof HTMLElement && activeElement.isConnected\n          && document.activeElement !== activeElement) {\n        activeElement.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n      }\n    }"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
