          "guid": "mth6nfv7xd1oupdb",
          "message": {
            "text": "The isolated pseudo surface preserves Blink's two-owner model for generated URL content. Chromium's DOMSnapshot exposes the pseudo layout-slot quad but not a separately addressable anonymous LayoutImage overflow quad; scaling the image row into the slot loses the intrinsic 128x128 paint, so the smallest exact source-owned boundary is Chromium's isolated pseudo surface.",
            "markdown": "The isolated pseudo surface preserves Blink's two-owner model for generated URL content. Chromium's DOMSnapshot exposes the pseudo layout-slot quad but not a separately addressable anonymous LayoutImage overflow quad; scaling the image row into the slot loses the intrinsic 128x128 paint, so the smallest exact source-owned boundary is Chromium's isolated pseudo surface."
          },
          "locations": [
